[2026-09-21 15:17:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   polarity structure: if the proper-time boundary is screened by
[2026-09-21 15:17:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   local heliospheric plasma density, the comet transit structure
[2026-09-21 15:17:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   should track the contemporaneous solar-wind dynamic pressure at
[2026-09-21 15:17:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   each perihelion epoch.  Solar Cycle 24 peaked in 2014 and declined
[2026-09-21 15:17:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   through the 2018-2021 minimum -- the same window in which the
[2026-09-21 15:17:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 136]   declared/displaced polarity transition sits (step 130).
